# generated by `cargo xtask schema dump` — do not edit; the encoder is the description
# crate: fjell-measure-format
# format: compute_image_set_digest
# version: first generated in v0.38.0
# not described: nothing reads these bytes back -- the digest is the whole point, and the kernel and a host tool each recompute it from the same images -- so this file and the encoder are the only description a second implementation has; the format carries no version field of its own, its domain tag (`FJELL-IMAGE-SET-V1`) is the version (RFC-0.38-001 R2)
domain "FJELL-IMAGE-SET-V1"
field image_count            u16 LE
note image_order images follow in strictly ascending image_id order; image_count is the number of entries
note image_digest_is SHA-256 of the image's flat binary exactly as embedded (the prebuilt .bin), no prefix
group images max 64
field images[].image_id      u16 LE
field images[].image_digest  u8 [32]
end
